  "question": {
    "text": "A body <math><mi>P</mi></math> floats in water with half its volume immersed. Another body <math><mi>Q</mi></math> floats in a liquid of density <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></math> of the density of water with two-third of the volume immersed. The ratio of density of <math><mi>P</mi></math> to that of <math><mi>Q</mi></math> is"
  },
